menu "Modbus Slave Configuration"

    config MB_SLAVE_ADDR
        int "Modbus slave address (UID)"
        range 1 247
        default 1
        help
            Modbus slave (unit) address used by this device on the RTU bus.

    config MB_SLAVE_UART_PORT_NUM
        int "UART port number"
        range 0 2
        default 1
        help
            UART port number used for the Modbus RTU serial connection.

            Note: the actual TXD / RXD / RTS pins are configured under
            "Component config -> Modbus configuration", provided by the
            esp-modbus component.

    config MB_SLAVE_UART_BAUD
        int "UART baud rate"
        range 1200 921600
        default 115200
        help
            Baud rate of the Modbus RTU serial connection. Must match the
            Modbus master configuration.

endmenu
